          %h2#References References
          %div
            %h3#elliptic_cohomology Elliptic cohomology
            %h4#general General
            %p
              The concept of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+cohomology"} elliptic cohomology
              originates around:
            %ul
              %li#Landweber88
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Landweber"}> Peter Landweber
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic Cohomology and Modular Forms
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic Curves and Modular Forms in Algebraic Topology
                  %strong 1326
                  (1988) 55-68 &amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0078038"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0078038
                  \&amp;rbrack;
              %li#LandweberRavenelStong93
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Landweber"}> Peter Landweber
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Ravenel"} Douglas Ravenel
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Stong"} Robert Stong
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Periodic cohomology theories defined by elliptic curves
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Haynes+Miller"} Haynes Miller
                  et. al. (eds.),
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The Cech centennial: A conference on homotopy theory
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.math.sciences.univ-nantes.fr/~hossein/GdT-Elliptique/Landweber-Ravenel-Stong.pdf"} pdf
            %p
              and in the universal guise of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+modular+forms"} topological modular forms
              in:
            %ul
              %li#Hopkins02
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"}> Michael Hopkins
                ,
                %em Algebraic topology and modular forms
                in Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians, Vol. I (Beijing, 2002), pages 291–317, Beijing, 2002. Higher Ed. Press (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0212397"}> arXiv:math/0212397
                )
            %p Surveys:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Greenberg"}> Matthew Greenberg
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Constructing elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://www.bac-lac.gc.ca/eng/services/theses/Pages/item.aspx?idNumber=898194373"} oclc:898194373
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GreenbergEllipticCohomology.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Goerss"}> Paul Goerss
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Topological modular forms (after Hopkins, Miller, and Lurie)
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0910.5130"} arXiv:0910.5130
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/AST_2010__332__221_0"} numdam:AST_2010__332__221_0
              %li#Lurie
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A+Survey+of+Elliptic+Cohomology"} A Survey of Elliptic Cohomology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Algebraic Topology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.math.harvard.edu/~lurie/papers/survey.pdf"} pdf
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-01200-6_9"} doi:10.1007/978-3-642-01200-6_9
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Rezk"}> Charles Rezk
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic cohomology and elliptic curves
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.hcm.uni-bonn.de/fkl-rezk"} web
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://faculty.math.illinois.edu/~rezk/felix-klein-lectures-notes.pdf"} pdf
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/RezkElliptic2015.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %p Textbook accounts:
            %ul
              %li#Thomas02
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Thomas"}> Charles Thomas
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/b115001"} doi:10.1007/b115001
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007%2Fb115001.pdf"} pdf
              %li#DFHH14
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Douglas"}> Christopher Douglas
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Francis"} John Francis
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Henriques"} André Henriques
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hill"} Michael Hill
                  (eds.),
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Topological Modular Forms
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://bookstore.ams.org/surv-201"} ISBN:978-1-4704-1884-7
            %h4#equivariant_elliptic_cohomology Equivariant elliptic cohomology
            %p
              On
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} equivariant elliptic cohomology
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/positive+energy+representations"} positive energy representations
              of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/loop+groups"} loop groups
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eduard+Looijenga"}> Eduard Looijenga
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Root systems and elliptic curves
                %p
                  38(1):17–32, 1976/77 (
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01390167"}> doi:10.1007/BF01390167
                  )
              %li#Grojnowski94
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ian+Grojnowski"}> Ian Grojnowski
                  ,
                  %em Delocalised equivariant elliptic cohomology
                  (1994), in:
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "http://hopf.math.purdue.edu/Grojnowski/deloc.pdf"} pdf
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511721489.007"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511721489.007
              %li#GinzburgKapranovVasserot95
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Victor+Ginzburg"}> Victor Ginzburg
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mikhail+Kapranov"} Mikhail Kapranov
                  %em Elliptic Algebras and Equivariant Elliptic Cohomology
                  (
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9505012"}> arXiv:q-alg/9505012
                  )
              %li#Ando00
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Power operations in elliptic cohomology and representations of loop groups
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.jstor.org/stable/221905"} jstor:221905
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://www.math.uiuc.edu/~mando/papers/POECLG/poeclg.pdf"} pdf
              %li#Gepner05
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Gepner"}> David Gepner
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Homotopy+topoi+and+equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} Homotopy topoi and equivariant elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GepnerElliptic05.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %li#GepnerMeier20
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Gepner"}> David Gepner
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lennart+Meier"} Lennart Meier
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em On equivariant topological modular forms
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.10254"} arXiv:2004.10254
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mich%C3%A8le+Vergne"}> Michèle Vergne
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Bouquets revisited and equivariant elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.00312"} arXiv:2005.00312
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0129167X21400127"} doi:10.1142/S0129167X21400127
            %p
              Relation to
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kac-Weyl+characters"} Kac-Weyl characters
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/loop+group+representations"} loop group representations
            %ul
              %li#Brylinski90
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean-Luc+Brylinski"}> Jean-Luc Brylinski
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Representations of loop groups, Dirac operators on loop space, and modular forms
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(90)90016-D"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(90)90016-D
              %li#Ganter12
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nora+Ganter"}> Nora Ganter
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The elliptic Weyl character formula
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1206.0528"} arXiv:1206.0528
            %p
              The case of
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+ad-equivariant+Tate+K-theory"} twisted ad-equivariant Tate K-theory
            %ul
              %li#Ganter07
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nora+Ganter"}> Nora Ganter
                  , Section 3.1 in:
                  %em Stringy power operations in Tate K-theory
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0701565"}> arXiv:math/0701565
                  )
              %li#Ganter13
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nora+Ganter"}> Nora Ganter
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Power operations in orbifold Tate K-theory
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1301.2754"} arXiv:1301.2754
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/euclid.hha/1383943680"} euclid:hha/1383943680
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Quasi-elliptic cohomology
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://hdl.handle.net/2142/97268"} hdl
              %li#Huan18
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Quasi-Elliptic Cohomology I
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.06305"} arXiv:1805.06305
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2018.08.007"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2018.08.007
              %li#Huan18Quasi
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
                  ,
                  %em Quasi-theories
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.06651"}> arXiv:1809.06651
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  Kiran Luecke,
                  %em Completed K-theory and Equivariant Elliptic Cohomology
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.00085"}> arXiv:1904.00085
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Dove"}> Thomas Dove
                  ,
                  %em Twisted Equivariant Tate K-Theory
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.02374"}> arXiv:1912.02374
                  )
            %p See also:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Berwick-Evans"}> Daniel Berwick-Evans
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arnav+Tripathy"} Arnav Tripathy
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A geometric model for complex analytic equivariant elliptic cohomology
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.04146"} arXiv:1805.04146
            %h4#via_derived_geometry
              Via derived
              = succeed "-geometry" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi E
                        %mn ∞
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_\infty
            %p
              Formulation of (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"}> equivariant
              )
