            %h3#elliptic_genera Elliptic genera
            %h4#general_2 General
            %p
              The general concept of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
              originates with:
            %ul
              %li#Ochanine87
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Serge+Ochanine"}> Serge Ochanine
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Sur les genres multiplicatifs definis par des integrales elliptiques
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.sciences.univ-nantes.fr/~hossein/GdT-Elliptique/Mult-genre-Ochanine.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(87)90055-3"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(87)90055-3
            %p Early development:
            %ul
              %li#Zagier86
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Don+Zagier"}> Don Zagier
                  ,
                  %em Note on the Landweber-Stong elliptic genus
                  1986 (
                  %a{:href => "http://people.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/zagier/files/doi/10.1007/BFb0078047/fulltext.pdf"}> pdf
                  ,
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://edoc.mpg.de/744944"} edoc:744944
              %li#ChudnovskyChudnovsky88
                %p
                  D.V. Chudnovsky, G.V. Chudnovsky,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Elliptic modular functions and elliptic genera
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0040-9383(88)90035-3"} doi:10.1016/0040-9383(88)90035-3
              %li#Hovey91
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mark+Hovey"}> Mark Hovey
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Spin Bordism and Elliptic Homology
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02572356"} doi:10.1007/BF02572356
              %li#KreckStolz93
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Kreck"}> Matthias Kreck
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephan+Stolz"} Stephan Stolz
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %msup
                              %mi HP
                              %mn 2
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} HP^2
                      \-bundles and elliptic homology
                  = succeed "," do
